{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KgJ4GhKs5E1792737411.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產奧運站奧海城分行首席分區營業經理黃家全表示，中原最新促成一宗南昌站匯璽租賃成交，單位為6座中層H室，實用面積379平方呎，屬一房一廁間隔，單位座向北方，外望開揚市景，最新以25500元租出，折合實用呎租67元。<br/>中原地產黃家全指，上址業主於2019年10月以870萬元購入單位，持貨7年，是次租出單位可享3.5厘租金回報，回報理想。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.697499+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:41.374666+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:12.148931+00:00","content_hash":"4077375311467f34001a1181f3821802b9f6dd203e2871eab399a45d701c0d12","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.697499+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}